      "message": "Yeah, I played around with your first suggestion and it turned into more lines than I wanted (SkString + std::string + static char arr concatenation typing issues). Nothing was particularly pleasing, but you\u0027re right re: overhead. I took your second suggestion, TY for your thoughts there~\n\nIt can be a bit clunky (given that we only want to pass in the desc on builds where we are performing this tracing / care about labels; otherwise it is unused entirely). There are ofc other options, but here\u0027s one I may actually propose:\n\n* We could have a separate trace event that prints the RpDesc label. e.g.\n```\n    {\n        TRACE_EVENT0_ALWAYS(\"skia.shaders\", \"GraphitePipelineUse\");\n        \n        // Add trace event for RPDesc here\n        \n        for (int i \u003d 0 ; i \u003c fFullPipelines.size(); ++i) {\n            // print each pipeline label here as usual\n        }\n    }\n```\n\nLMKWYT!",
